{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1979", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1979/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1979/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1979/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1979", "id": 1572834151, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5dv4tn", "number": 1979, "title": "Failure and Shell plugins work without true result", "user": {"login": "ArtBor86", "id": 92856492, "node_id": "U_kgDOBYjgrA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92856492?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86", "html_url": "https://github.com/ArtBor86", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2023-02-06T15:58:16Z", "updated_at": "2023-02-07T20:14:27Z", "closed_at": "2023-02-07T20:14:27Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi!\r\nI tried to use Failure and Shell plugin to to inject failures (gps off) into system to test failsafes.\r\n\r\nAUTOPILOT is Pixhawk 5x\r\nOnboard computer RPi+ 4B\r\nSerial connection TELEM2.\r\n\r\n### What I want\r\n\r\nIn MAVLink Console I can send command \"gps\" stop and \"gps start\".\r\n![e2dde5d2258f0cfd9d06ade026755a8e0c68ae64](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/92856492/217016356-8fc1868d-aff0-4324-bb7e-fea3140a2dd2.png)\r\n\r\nI want do this using MAVSDK C++\r\n\r\n### What I done \r\nAt first I tried do it by MAVSDK C++ [Failure plugin](https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/main/en/cpp/api_reference/classmavsdk_1_1_failure.html).\r\nSYS_FAILURE_EN = Enabled\r\n```\r\nauto failure = std::make_shared<mavsdk::Failure>(system);\r\nauto result = failure->inject(mavsdk::Failure::FailureUnit::SensorGps,mavsdk::Failure::FailureType::Off,0);\r\nstd::cout << \"Result\\t\" << result << std::endl;\r\n```\r\nand had some bad result\r\n```\r\n[03:15:05|Warn ] sending again after 0.5003 s, retries to do: 3  (420). (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:287)\r\n[03:15:05|Warn ] sending again after 1.00061 s, retries to do: 2  (420). (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:287)\r\n[03:15:06|Warn ] sending again after 1.5092 s, retries to do: 1  (420). (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:287)\r\n[03:15:06|Error] Retrying failed (420) (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:307)\r\nResult  Timeout\r\n```\r\nAt second I tried do it by MAVSDK C++ [Shell plugin](https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/main/en/cpp/api_reference/classmavsdk_1_1_shell.html)\r\n```\r\nauto shell = std::make_shared<mavsdk::Shell>(system);\r\nauto result = shell->send(\"gps stop\");\r\nstd::cout << \"Result\\t\" << result << std::endl;\r\n```\r\n`Result Success`\r\n**But gps didn't actually stoped.**\r\n\r\nWhat can I try else?\r\nThanks!", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.co